 "r1-date-table-and-dax-catalogue": "The date table and DAX catalogue is the single reference for every measure in the Beacon semantic model: its business definition, its exact Data Analysis Expressions (DAX), how blanks and small counts behave, and its tested result compared with the approved figures. It also holds the Power Query code for DimDate and the rule for marking it as the date table. Tomás Rivera (E-006) writes the measures, Mei Tanaka (E-013) tests them, and the business owners of each figure, Dr. Sarah Whitford (E-007), Janelle Cardinal (E-008) and Grace Liu (E-005), agree the definitions. You build it in week 4. Any new or changed measure, such as those for CR-01, is added here and tested before it is published.",
