  "domain": "Prepare the data · Profile and clean the data",
  "prompt": "Your query ED_Typed sets the column types:\n\n```\nlet\n    Source = ED_Raw,\n    Typed = Table.TransformColumnTypes(\n        Source,\n        {{\"arrival_datetime\", type datetime}, {\"ctas_level\", Int64.Type}}\n    )\nin\n    Typed\n```\n\nColumn quality for arrival_datetime now shows one Error. The row is V0476, whose text value is 2026-09-31 10:41. What is the best way to handle it?",
